This should resolve the crypto module error while maintaining the same functionality. The Web Crypto API is a secure, standardized way to perform cryptographic operations in the browser.

Note that the new implementation is asynchronous, so any code that uses these functions will need to handle the promises they return. Make sure to update any code that calls these functions to use async/await or .then() chains.

