1. Imported the OrgBrandingProvider from the organizations context
2. Created a mock organization branding data object that matches the expected OrganizationBranding type
3. Wrapped the ImportedComponent with OrgBrandingProvider and passed the mock data
4. The mock data includes all required fields from the OrganizationBranding type

This should resolve the "useOrgBranding was used outside of OrgBrandingProvider" error by providing the necessary context to the component tree. The mock data provides a realistic organization branding context that should allow the component to function properly.

